1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,450
Intensity goes as amplitude squared.

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:10,026
So the transmitted intensity is k, A cos theta, squared, which is I nought cos squared theta.

3
00:00:10,026 --> 00:00:11,692
That is Malus's law.

4
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:14,505
Parallel axes let all of it through.

5
00:00:14,505 --> 00:00:19,036
Crossed axes, at ninety degrees, let nothing through.

